    \textbf{Left (Score Aggregation)}: Local pairwise matching $\to$ score matrix per entity pair $\to$ scalar/vector aggregation $\to$ global decision.
    \textbf{Right (Profile Aggregation)}: Per-entity record aggregation $\to$ behavioural profile vectors $\to$ set-similarity matching $\to$ \textbf{Layer-2 Splink (required)} $\to$ global decision.}
